#     command buffer uses it (it then rides in that command buffer's surface_relocs), anv_xemtl_cmd_exclusive(cmd)
#     promises its declarations are complete, anv_xemtl_stats(out[3]) reports marked memories, declared uses and
#     memories left out of submits.
